# Dockerfile.dockerignore — BuildKit applies it only to `-f Dockerfile` (GPU image).
# Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile COPYs enters the build context.
# Datasets (data/, train/, public_test/), eval/, scripts/, tests/ and .git stay out.
*

!requirements.txt
!predict.sh
!README.md
!src/
!training_code/

# Only the submitted model. Other checkpoints in models/ (e.g. Qwen3-8B) must not
# enter the image: the rule is <=15B parameters for all inference models combined.
!models/README.md
!models/Qwen3-14B/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
